														<r3d:remarks>Description: &quot;GESDB is a platform for sharing simulation data and discussion of simulation techniques for human genetic studies. The database contains simulation scripts, simulated data, and documentations from published manuscripts. The forum provides a platform for Q&amp;A for the simulated data and exchanging simulation ideas. GESDB aims to promote transparency and efficiency in simulation studies for human genetic studies.&quot;
Yao PJ, Chung RH: GESDB: a platform of simulation resources for genetic epidemiology studies http://dx.doi.org/10.1093/database/baw082</r3d:remarks>
